{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>聲明表示，此舉系「為順應全球化新能源發展趨勢，根據公司發展戰略需求」，旨在為用户提供更高品質的綠色出行產品與服務。對既有燃油汽車用户，MG將繼續提供完善的維保服務與全周期零部件供給，保障用户正常用車與售後權益。</p>\n<p>MG稱，作為面向全球的中國汽車品牌，將充分尊重各區域市場的能源結構、消費習慣與政策環境，堅持以技術創新為核心驅動力，因地制宜推進新能源轉型。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/728/w550h978/20261128/e916-724c96456bbe5acdbff8d965fe847192.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/728/w550h978/20261128/e916-724c96456bbe5acdbff8d965fe847192.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.848583+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:31:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:34.350141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:30.544607+00:00","content_hash":"77e5e8496b9c53d3c454bf468d7a7ed8cbc20a7d87965f94068d254c80fbc17d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}